     * http://www.gzip.org/zlib/rfc-gzip.html#file-format
     *
     * zip file:        { 0x50, 0x4B, 0x03, 0x04 }
     * http://www.pkware.com/documents/casestudies/APPNOTE.TXT (Section 4.3)
